+- **priority_label:** The user-facing priority string, typically combining an expressive semantic emoji and clear text (e.g. `🔴 Urgent`, `🟠 High`, `🟡 Medium`, `🔵 Low`).
+- **exclusive_group:** An optional label category constraint. When applied to tags (e.g. `tier:free`, `tier:pro`), applying one tag from the group automatically removes any previously attached tags in that same exclusive group.
